Design a **high-intensity interval training (HIIT)** program in valid **JSON** format.

The program must:
- Last between **10 and 30 minutes** in total.
- Be suitable for an **intermediate** fitness level.
- Include three sections: `"warm_up"`, `"main_set"`, and `"cool_down"`.
- Vary in types of exercises, training structures, durations, rest periods, and intensities.
- Include a wide variety of exercise types, such as bodyweight, weighted/barbell-style, plyometric, core, or mobility exercises, to keep the session diverse and engaging.
- Vary the duration of exercises, not all should have similar times.
- Only add exercises doable at home with minimal or no equitment.

Each exercise object must have:
- `"name"` (string)
- `"duration"` (seconds, integer)
- `"rest"` (seconds, integer)
- `"type"` (e.g. "cardio", "strength", "core", "flexibility", "stretching")
- `"intensity"` (low, medium, or high)

The `"main_set"` can include one optional `"structure"` field (e.g. "AMRAP", "EMOM", "Tabata").  
When a structure is provided, all exercise durations, rest periods, and repetitions must be consistent with the defined structure's timing constraints (e.g., "EMOM" requires 60-second work intervals aligned to each minute).
Avoid nested blocks or overly complex structures.

Output **only JSON**, no code fences, no explanations.

Limit total JSON length to under 1500 characters.

Example:

{
  "warm_up": [
    { "name": "Jumping Jacks", "duration": 30, "rest": 10, "type": "cardio", "intensity": "low" },
    { "name": "Arm Circles", "duration": 20, "rest": 10, "type": "mobility", "intensity": "low" }
  ],
  "main_set": {
    "structure": "Tabata",
    "rounds": 4,
    "exercises": [
      { "name": "Burpees", "duration": 40, "rest": 20, "type": "cardio", "intensity": "high" },
      { "name": "Push-ups", "duration": 30, "rest": 20, "type": "strength", "intensity": "medium" },
      { "name": "Jump Squats", "duration": 30, "rest": 15, "type": "strength/cardio", "intensity": "high" }
    ]
  },
  "cool_down": [
    { "name": "Forward Fold", "duration": 30, "rest": 10, "type": "flexibility", "intensity": "low" },
    { "name": "Child's Pose", "duration": 30, "rest": 10, "type": "recovery", "intensity": "low" }
  ]
}
